    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "2. Geospatial Analysis"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> Geospatial analysis involves analyzing data with location information (latitude, longitude)."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Key Concepts:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Spatial data (maps, coordinates)",
        "Layers (roads, buildings, population zones)",
        "Spatial queries (distance, overlap, intersection)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Applications:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Traffic flow mapping",
        "Land use planning",
        "Disaster management"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "3. Dashboards and Visualization Tools"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> Dashboards provide interactive visual insights from data."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Tools:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "<strong>Tableau:</strong> Drag-and-drop visual analytics platform",
        "<strong>Power BI:</strong> Microsoft's business intelligence tool"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Features:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Real-time updates",
        "Interactive filters",
        "Multi-source data integration"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "4. Real-Time Analytics"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> Processing data as it is generated, with no or minimal delay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Examples:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Live traffic updates",
        "Emergency response systems",
        "Pollution monitoring"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Technologies:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Stream processing systems (Apache Kafka, Spark Streaming)",
        "Cloud-based analytics platforms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "5. PostGIS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> PostGIS is an extension of PostgreSQL that adds support for geographic objects, enabling spatial queries."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Features:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Store spatial/geographic data",
        "Perform geographic queries",
        "Integrate with GIS tools like QGIS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Example Query:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "sql",
      "code": "SELECT * FROM roads\nWHERE ST_Distance(location, point) < 500;\n\n-- 👉 Finds all roads within 500 meters of a given point."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Use Cases:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Route optimization",
        "Urban planning (zoning analysis)",
        "Location-based services"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "6. Urban Simulation"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> Simulation models represent real-world urban systems digitally to test scenarios before real implementation."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Types:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Traffic simulation",
        "Population movement simulation",
        "Infrastructure planning simulation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section_heading",
      "text": "7. Agent-Based Simulation"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<strong>Definition:</strong> Simulates the behavior of individual agents (people, vehicles) and how their interactions produce system-level behavior."
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Key Idea:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Each agent follows simple rules",
        "Complex system behavior emerges from interactions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Example: Traffic Simulation"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Each car = one agent",
        "Rules = speed limits, signal behavior, lane changes",
        "Output = emergent traffic patterns, congestion zones"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sub_heading",
      "text": "Applications:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "style": "unordered",
      "items": [
        "Crowd movement modeling",
        "Traffic congestion analysis",
        "Emergency evacuation planning"
      ]
    },
    {
